From: Ilies CHERGUI <ichergui@nvidia.com>
Subject: [PATCH] python: Accept pybind11 3.0.1

The 3.0.3 minimum comes from the versions.env pin for the wheel builds,
not from an API the bindings use. meta-python on wrynose ships 3.0.1, so
ask for any 3.0 release.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [wrynose-specific]
Signed-off-by: Ilies CHERGUI <ichergui@nvidia.com>
---
--- a/python/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/python/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -45,7 +45,7 @@
                             "Is pybind11 installed? Try: python${CVCUDA_PYTHON_VERSION} -m pip install pybind11")
     endif()
 endif()
-find_package(pybind11 3.0.3 REQUIRED CONFIG)
+find_package(pybind11 3.0 REQUIRED CONFIG)
 
 find_package(nvcv_types REQUIRED)
 
